on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 61 ............................. <61>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <61>
  [  5] extcall 17 .............................. <rollOver(61)>
  [  7] jmpifz [ 26] ............................ if rollOver(61) then
  [ 10] pushint8 63 ............................. <63>
  [ 13] pushint8 61 ............................. <61>
  [ 16] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 19] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 61>
  [ 21] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 24] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 63 to the locV of sprite 61
  [ 26] pushint8 62 ............................. <62>
  [ 29] pusharglist 1 ........................... <62>
  [ 31] extcall 17 .............................. <rollOver(62)>
  [ 33] jmpifz [ 52] ............................ if rollOver(62) then
  [ 36] pushint8 63 ............................. <63>
  [ 39] pushint8 62 ............................. <62>
  [ 42] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 45] get 6 ................................... <the locV of sprite 62>
  [ 47] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 50] set 6 ................................... set the locV of sprite 63 to the locV of sprite 62
  [ 52] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 54] extcall 18 .............................. updateStage()
  [ 56] ret
end
